    "svg": "curriculum/beginner/07-visual-embeddings-metric-learning-retrieval/assets/retrieval-failure-taxonomy.svg",
    "medium": "documentation and notebook",
    "alt_text": "A suspicious retrieval result fans out into wrong semantic neighbour, source shortcut, duplicate leakage, hard or false negative, rare-class miss, cross-version incompatibility, and filter-induced miss."
